COMMENT ON TABLE  DS_DISPATCH_PROFILE            IS '배차 프로파일';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DS_DISPATCH_PROFILE.PROFILE_ID IS '프로파일 ID (PK)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DS_DISPATCH_PROFILE.PROFILE_NM IS '프로파일명';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DS_DISPATCH_PROFILE.OBJECTIVE  IS '목적식 코드';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DS_DISPATCH_PROFILE.ACTIVE_YN  IS '활성여부';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DS_DISPATCH_PROFILE.NOTE       IS '비고';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DS_DISPATCH_PROFILE.SET_ID     IS '연결 CONST_SET ID';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DS_DISPATCH_PROFILE.CREDAT     IS '생성일자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN DS_DISPATCH_PROFILE.LMODAT     IS '수정일자';


